    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταργᾰνόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάργανον</span>) <i>to be turned into vinegar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος τεταργανωμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					189
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταργάνη</span>) <i>to be plaited</i> or
				<i>entwined</i>, <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
					<u>EM</u>753.54</span></i>: cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσταργανόω</span>.</div>
